            "html": "<p>McDermott describes R1, a rule-based program built with Digital Equipment Corporation to configure VAX computer orders: turning a customer's order into a complete, valid set of components and how they fit together. The paper presents expert knowledge as something that can be captured in a large set of if-then rules, and treats R1's use in daily business at DEC as proof that this works in practice.</p>",
