            "html": "<p>Mikolov, Tomas, Kai Chen, Greg Corrado, and Jeffrey Dean. 2013. &quot;Efficient Estimation of Word Representations in Vector Space.&quot; <em>arXiv</em> 1301.3781. January 16, 2013. https://arxiv.org/abs/1301.3781</p><p>Source used for this note: the arXiv v3 PDF (September 7, 2013), first eight pages.</p>",
            "text": "Mikolov, Tomas, Kai Chen, Greg Corrado, and Jeffrey Dean. 2013. \"Efficient Estimation of Word Representations in Vector Space.\" arXiv 1301.3781. January 16, 2013. https://arxiv.org/abs/1301.3781\n\nSource used for this note: the arXiv v3 PDF (September 7, 2013), first eight pages."
