            "title": "Why This Matters",
            "html": "<p>TensorFlow moved the core infrastructure of deep learning from a company's private datacenters into public code. For Synthesis — AI as Technology History, the release shows a pattern in AI's history: the largest firms shaped the field not only through models but by giving away the tools others used to build models. The open license widened access, and it also made Google's design choices the starting point for a large share of outside work. The later competition with PyTorch shows that this attempt at closure was contested.</p>",
