            "html": "<p>Amodei, Dario, Chris Olah, Jacob Steinhardt, Paul Christiano, John Schulman, and Dan Mané. 2016. &quot;Concrete Problems in AI Safety.&quot; <em>arXiv</em> 1606.06565. June 21, 2016 (v2 July 25, 2016). https://arxiv.org/abs/1606.06565</p>",
