            "html": "<ul><li>&quot;It does not intend to lobby government or other policymaking bodies.&quot;</li></ul><p>The Partnership defines itself outside the policy process.</p><ul><li>&quot;There will be equal representation of corporate and non-corporate members on the board of this new organization.&quot;</li></ul><p>The governance promise, set by the founding firms.</p><ul><li>&quot;The organization’s founding members will each contribute financial and research resources to the partnership&quot;</li></ul><p>Who funds the forum.</p><ul><li>&quot;we believe it’s critical that we build new models of open collaboration and accountability around it&quot;</li></ul><p>DeepMind's framing: accountability through industry collaboration.</p><ul><li>&quot;breaking down barriers between AI teams across leading companies&quot;</li></ul><p>Coordination among the major developers presented as the step forward.</p>",
            "text": "- \"It does not intend to lobby government or other policymaking bodies.\"\n  The Partnership defines itself outside the policy process.\n- \"There will be equal representation of corporate and non-corporate members on the board of this new organization.\"\n  The governance promise, set by the founding firms.\n- \"The organization’s founding members will each contribute financial and research resources to the partnership\"\n  Who funds the forum.\n- \"we believe it’s critical that we build new models of open collaboration and accountability around it\"\n  DeepMind's framing: accountability through industry collaboration.\n- \"breaking down barriers between AI teams across leading companies\"\n  Coordination among the major developers presented as the step forward."
