            "html": "<p>Every other AI note here is a <strong>primary source</strong> — a document produced by practitioners making claims about their own work. This one is <strong>secondary</strong> and methodological: it is the STS toolkit already turned on AI.</p><p>It is therefore the shortest bridge between the two halves of this vault. What Nye, Bijker, Hughes, Kline + Pinch, Fischer, Wolff and McChesney do for electricity, bicycles, automobiles, telephones, telegraphs and radio, this collection does for AI.</p>",
            "text": "Every other AI note here is a primary source — a document produced by practitioners making claims about their own work. This one is secondary and methodological: it is the STS toolkit already turned on AI.\n\nIt is therefore the shortest bridge between the two halves of this vault. What Nye, Bijker, Hughes, Kline + Pinch, Fischer, Wolff and McChesney do for electricity, bicycles, automobiles, telephones, telegraphs and radio, this collection does for AI."
