            "text": "Patel, Dylan, and Afzal Ahmad. 2023. \"Google 'We Have No Moat, And Neither Does OpenAI.'\" SemiAnalysis, May 4, 2023. https://newsletter.semianalysis.com/p/google-we-have-no-moat-and-neither"
