        "citation": "Perrigo, Billy. 2023. \"Exclusive: OpenAI Lobbied the E.U. to Water Down AI Regulation.\" TIME. June 20, 2023. https://time.com/6288245/openai-eu-lobbying-ai-act/",
        "keyClaim": "Based on a previously unpublished OpenAI white paper to the European Commission obtained through freedom-of-information requests, Perrigo reports that while Sam Altman toured world capitals publicly calling for AI regulation, OpenAI was simultaneously lobbying European Commission and Council officials to keep general-purpose systems like GPT-3 out of the EU AI Act's \"high risk\" category. The article documents specific amendments OpenAI proposed in September 2022 and argues that the final text approved by the European Parliament in June 2023 incorporated several of them, including the introduction of a separate, less-restrictive \"foundation models\" category.",
