            "html": "<p>This note can only show when the board's position broke, not why. That gap is itself a finding about the episode: the public record on which this note is built — a corporate statement, a four-sentence post, a CEO's return message — was written by people managing an unfolding crisis, not by people documenting it for a later account. Synthesis — AI as Technology History argues that AI governance is passing through the equivalent of broadcasting's early consolidation, where the legally and ideologically contested questions get settled by statements and resignations rather than by adjudicated fact. Sutskever's post is a clean instance: it is offered as an explanation and functions instead as a data point — the moment one insider's account started diverging from the institution's, three days after the institution acted and nine days before it reorganized around a different outcome.</p>",
