            "text": "- Before: OpenAI (2022) - Introducing ChatGPT, the product whose outputs Exhibit J examines, and Language Models are Few-Shot Learnings (GPT-3), the earlier generation of the model family the complaint alleges was trained on Times content.\n- After: outside this note's sources — the litigation's outcome, and any later copyright rulings, are not covered by this cache."
