            "html": "<p>Leike, Jan. 2024. Resignation thread. X (formerly Twitter). May 17, 2024. https://x.com/janleike/status/1791498178346549382</p><p>Brundage, Miles. 2024. &quot;Why I'm Leaving OpenAI.&quot; October 23, 2024.</p><p>Reuters. 2025. &quot;Meta's AI Chief Yann LeCun Planning to Leave to Launch Own Startup, FT Reports.&quot; Via Yahoo. November 2025.</p><p>TechCrunch. 2026. Report on Brad Lightcap's departure from OpenAI. August 11, 2026.</p>",
