            "text": "- Before: \"The Bletchley Declaration\" (Nov 2023), which this declaration names directly as the summit it builds on, and White House Voluntary AI Commitments (Jul 2023), whose company-pledge structure the Frontier AI Safety Commitments extend to a larger, more international set of signatories.\n- After: outside this note's sources. Whether the sixteen companies published safety frameworks by the France summit is not covered by this cache."
