        "citation": "Countries Attending the AI Seoul Summit. 2024. \"Seoul Declaration for Safe, Innovative and Inclusive AI,\" with the accompanying \"Frontier AI Safety Commitments.\" AI Seoul Summit. May 21, 2024. https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/seoul-declaration-for-safe-innovative-and-inclusive-ai-ai-seoul-summit-2024/seoul-declaration-for-safe-innovative-and-inclusive-ai-by-participants-attending-the-leaders-session-ai-seoul-summit-21-may-2024",
        "keyClaim": "Eleven governments and the EU, meeting six months after Bletchley, affirm continued cooperation on AI safety, innovation, and inclusivity, and note a companion document — the Frontier AI Safety Commitments — in which sixteen named AI developers pledge to publish a safety framework addressing severe risks by the next summit, in France. The commitments set out what those frameworks must cover: identifying and assessing risks, defining thresholds at which risk becomes \"intolerable,\" and being transparent about how the framework is implemented — without specifying who verifies that any company has actually met these commitments.",
