            "text": "European Union. 2024. Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 Laying Down Harmonised Rules on Artificial Intelligence (Artificial Intelligence Act). Official Journal of the European Union. July 12, 2024. https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1689/oj/eng"
