            "text": "- Agenda Control: OpenAI frames its own announcement — the board has \"an updated plan,\" Sam \"wrote the letter below to our employees and stakeholders about why we are so excited for this new direction\" — which sets the terms on which the reversal will be read, as an evolution the company chose rather than a concession it was pressed into by the Attorneys General named in the same paragraph.\n- The Attorneys General of Delaware and California function as the relevant social group whose objection is visible in the text without their own words appearing in it: the post reports only the result of \"constructive dialogue\", not what was disputed or how close OpenAI came to the alternative plan hinted at by the phrase \"an updated plan\"."
