        "citation": "OpenAI. 2025. \"Evolving OpenAI's Structure.\" OpenAI. May 5, 2025. https://openai.com/index/evolving-our-structure/. And OpenAI. 2025. \"Built to Benefit Everyone.\" OpenAI. October 28, 2025. https://openai.com/index/built-to-benefit-everyone/.",
        "keyClaim": "In May 2025, OpenAI's board announces \"an updated plan\" under which the nonprofit will keep control of the company, reversing course after what the post calls \"constructive dialogue\" with the offices of the Attorneys General of Delaware and California. The for-profit LLC converts from a capped-profit structure to a Public Benefit Corporation (PBC) with ordinary stock, while the nonprofit remains the controlling shareholder. In October 2025, OpenAI announces the recapitalization is complete: the nonprofit, renamed the OpenAI Foundation, holds equity in the renamed OpenAI Group PBC valued at approximately $130 billion, and commits an initial $25 billion to health research and \"technical soluti",
