        "citation": "Anthropic. 2025. \"Disrupting the First Reported AI-Orchestrated Cyber Espionage Campaign.\" November 13, 2025. https://www.anthropic.com/news/disrupting-AI-espionage",
        "keyClaim": "Anthropic's blog post describes detecting, in mid-September 2025, what it calls \"a highly sophisticated espionage campaign,\" which it attributes with \"high confidence\" to a Chinese state-sponsored group. The group, Anthropic says, manipulated its Claude Code tool into functioning as the \"orchestrator and execution engine\" of an attack against roughly thirty targets, with Claude itself performing \"80-90% of the campaign\" and human operators intervening only at a handful of decision points. Anthropic frames the case as the first documented large-scale cyberattack \"executed without substantial human intervention,\" and uses it to argue that continued development of AI, paired with safeguards, is",
