            "text": "- \"Anthropic has raised $65 billion in Series H funding led by Altimeter Capital, Dragoneer, Greenoaks, and Sequoia Capital, valuing the company at $965 billion post-money.\"\n  The headline transaction.\n\n- \"our run-rate revenue crossed $47 billion earlier this month\"\n  The revenue figure Anthropic offers as justification for the round.\n\n- \"Claude is the first frontier model available on all three of the world's largest cloud platforms: Amazon Web Services, Google Cloud, and Microsoft Azure.\"\n  Anthropic's own claim about its infrastructure position.\n\n- \"We recently submitted a confidential S-1. We expect it to leak so we're just announcing it.\"\n  OpenAI's disclosure of its own IPO preparation, in its own words.\n\n- \"This gives us the option to go public after the SEC completes its review.\"\n  Anthropic's corresponding, more formal statement of the same fact."
