        "citation": "Anthropic. 2026. \"Anthropic Raises $65B at $965B Post-Money.\" Anthropic. May 28, 2026. https://www.anthropic.com/news/series-h. And Anthropic. 2026. Confidential Draft S-1 Notice. Anthropic. June 1, 2026. https://www.anthropic.com/news/confidential-draft-s1-sec. And OpenAI. 2026. \"OpenAI Submits Confidential S-1.\" OpenAI. June 8, 2026. https://openai.com/index/openai-submits-confidential-s-1/.",
        "keyClaim": "Anthropic announces a $65 billion Series H round at a $965 billion post-money valuation, reporting that its run-rate revenue \"crossed $47 billion earlier this month,\" and describing new gigawatt-scale compute agreements with Amazon, Google/Broadcom, and SpaceX. Four days later, Anthropic confidentially submits a draft S-1 for a possible IPO, and a week after that, OpenAI announces it has also submitted a confidential S-1, using the unusually direct line: \"we expect it to leak so we're just announcing it.\" The two frontier labs move toward public markets within eight days of each other.",
