        "citation": "Anthropic. 2026. \"Redeploying Claude Fable 5.\" Anthropic. June 30, 2026. https://www.anthropic.com/news/redeploying-fable-5",
        "keyClaim": "Anthropic explains that on June 12, 2026, the US government applied export controls to its newly released Claude Fable 5 and Claude Mythos 5, forcing Anthropic to suspend both models for all users because it had \"no reliable way to verify nationality in real-time.\" The controls were lifted June 30, after Anthropic worked with the government to build an improved safety classifier targeting a specific jailbreak an Amazon researcher had reported. The post uses the episode to argue for a shared industry framework for scoring jailbreak severity and for deeper, formalized collaboration between frontier labs and the US government on pre-release testing.",
