        "citation": "NVIDIA. 2026. \"NVIDIA Announces Financial Results for Second Quarter Fiscal 2027.\" NVIDIA Newsroom. August 26, 2026. https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-announces-financial-results-for-second-quarter-fiscal-2027.",
        "keyClaim": "NVIDIA reports Q2 fiscal 2027 revenue of $96.2 billion, up 106% year over year, with Data Center revenue of $89.0 billion, up 117% year over year. CEO Jensen Huang states that the buildout has moved from speculative infrastructure spending to realized income — \"Now, compute is revenue\" — and the release outlines an outlook of $108.0 billion for the following quarter alongside a series of financing and supply agreements meant to sustain the buildout at that scale.",
